WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,270 --> 00:00:04,510
She doesn't hit or curse, but the questions she asks are terrible

2
00:00:04,510 --> 00:00:09,170
One in the family is equal to one sister, what is the name of father and mother, and when will they be born? Be my next sentence

3
00:00:09,170 --> 00:00:14,060
I don't even have room to be lazy and think about it all

4
00:00:14,060 --> 00:00:17,460
Compared to my brother-in-law, I think you are too tolerant, brother.

5
00:00:17,460 --> 00:00:21,660
