6
00:00:21,660 --> 00:00:24,660
If it weren't for that face that was so outstanding, it wouldn't be an exaggeration to be number one.

7
00:00:24,660 --> 00:00:31,820
Carbon flower? That brother-in-law married a sister, it’s such a loss

8
00:00:31,820 --> 00:00:39,470
What are you looking at?

9
00:00:39,470 --> 00:00:43,959
My mother is really

10
00:00:43,959 --> 00:00:52,040
Why did you bring this too?
